ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Ability to give informed consent.\n2. Either pathological, genetic or imaging biomarker evidence to suggest Fronto-temporal Lobar Degeneration, Alzheimer\'s Disease or Vascular Cognitive Impairment, or defined clinical diagnoses.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "1. Ability to give informed consent."\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "2. Either pathological,",\n          "Modifier": [\n            "pathological"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "genetic",\n              "Modifier": [\n                "genetic"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "or imaging biomarker evidence to suggest Fronto-temporal Lobar Degeneration,",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "Fronto-temporal Lobar Degeneration"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "Fronto-temporal Lobar Degeneration"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "imaging"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "imaging"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "biomarker"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "biomarker"\n                  ],\n                  "Assertion": [\n                    "suggest"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "Alzheimer\'s Disease",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "Alzheimer\'s Disease"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "Alzheimer\'s Disease"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "or Vascular Cognitive Impairment, or defined clinical diagnoses.",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "Vascular Cognitive Impairment"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "Vascular Cognitive Impairment"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
