ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Age range between 2-6 years of age\n-  Gestational age range 26-34. be between weeks\n-  To be diagnosed with retinopathy of prematurity\n-  Neurological, hereditary and not having metabolic disease\n-  Compliance with visual examinations and physiotherapy evaluations\n-  To be children and parents who agree to participate in the study\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Age range between 2-6 years of age",\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "2-6 years"\n                      ],\n                      "Age": [\n                        "age"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "2",\n                        "6"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        "-"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                        "years"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Gestational age range 26-34. be between weeks",\n                      "Observation": [\n                        "Gestational age"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "26-34"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n     