ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Eye treated with XEN 45 Gel Stent for primary open angle glaucoma as a standalone procedure or in combination with phacoemulsification\n-  XEN 45 Gel Stent was implanted between 1 January 2014 and 1 October 2015\nExclusion Criteria\n-  None\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Eye treated with XEN 45 Gel Stent for primary open angle glaucoma as a standalone procedure",\n          "Procedure": [\n            "standalone procedure"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "standalone procedure"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "primary open angle"\n          ],\n          "Condition": [\n            "glaucoma"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "glaucoma"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "treated"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "treated"\n          ],\n          "Drug": [\n            "XEN 45 Gel Stent"\n          ],\n          "Drug-Name": [\n            "XEN 45 Gel Stent"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "Eye"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "Eye"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "or in combination with phacoemulsification",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "phacoemulsification"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "phacoemulsification"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "combination"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "NOT": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "without phacoemulsification",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "phacoemulsification"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "phacoemulsification"\n                  ],\n                  "Negation": [\n                    "without"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- XEN 45 Gel Stent was implanted between 1 January 2014 and 1 October 2015",\n      "Procedure": [\n        "implanted"\n      ],\n      "Procedure-Name": [\n        "implanted"\n      ],\n      "Drug": [\n        "XEN 45 Gel Stent"\n      ],\n      "Drug-Name": [\n        "XEN 45 Gel Stent"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "between 1 January 2014 and 1 October 2015"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "between"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "1"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n        "between"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n        "January",\n        "October"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
