ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Uncontrolled hypertension Systolic Blood Pressure >180 mm Hg\n-  Symptomatic coronary artery disease\n-  Pregnancy\n-  Not giving informed consent for the procedure\n-  Hypoxemia (oxygen saturation [by pulse oximetry] < 92% with Fio2 of ≥ 0.3\n-  Bronchoscopy performed through an artificial airway\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Uncontrolled hypertension Systolic Blood Pressure >180 mm Hg",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "hypertension"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation": [\n                        "Systolic Blood Pressure"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        ">180 mm Hg"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "hypertension"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation-Name": [\n                        "Systolic Blood Pressure"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        ">"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "180"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Unit": [\n                        "mm",\n                        "Hg"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "Uncontrolled"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Symptomatic coronary artery disease",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "coronary artery disease"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "coronary artery disease"\n                      ],\n                      "Assertion": [\n                        "Symptomatic"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Pregnancy",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "Pregnancy"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "Pregnancy"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Not giving informed consent for the procedure",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "procedure"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Hypoxemia (oxygen saturation [by pulse oximetry] < 92% with Fio2 of ≥ 0.3",\n          "Condition": [\n            "Hypoxemia"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "oxygen saturation"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "< 92%",\n            "≥ 0.3"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "Hypoxemia"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "oxygen saturation"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "<",\n            "≥"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "92",\n            "0.3"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Unit": [\n            "%"\n          ],\n          "Procedure": [\n            "pulse oximetry"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "pulse oximetry"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Bronchoscopy performed through an artificial airway",\n      "Procedure": [\n        "Bronchoscopy",\n        "artificial airway"\n      ],\n      "Procedure-Name": [\n        "Bronchoscopy",\n        "artificial airway"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
