ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  age 15 to 21,\n-  be able to read and understand English (as determined by having the individual read a brief, eighth grade reading level paragraph),\n-  able to begin the intervention within six weeks of their infant\'s birth,\n-  be able to participate in an intervention over two weeks, requiring approximately a 12-hour time commitment: either in-person on two Saturdays for six hours each, or a self-paced content of videos and resource materials over two weeks,\n-  own or have access to a device with internet access and\n-  have a working e-mail address.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "- age 15 to 21,",\n                          "Age": [\n                            "age"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "15 to 21"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Value": [\n                            "15",\n                            "21"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                            "to"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "- be able to read and understand English (as determined by having the individual read a brief, eighth grade reading level paragraph),",\n                          "Language": [\n                            "English"\n                          ],\n                          "Observation": [\n                            "read"\n                          ],\n                          "Observation-Name": [\n                            "read"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "eighth grade"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Unit": [\n                            "grade"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Value": [\n                            "eighth"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                            "to"\n                          ],\n                          "Assertion": [\n                            "able to"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- able to begin the intervention within six weeks of their infant\'s birth,",\n                      "Procedure": [\n                        "intervention"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure-Name": [\n                        "intervention"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "within six weeks"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        "within"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "six"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                        "weeks"\n                      ],\n                      "Family-Member": [\n                        "infant"\n                      ],\n                      "Birth": [\n                        "birth"\n                      ],\n   