ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  the emergency departments assessment of a critical clinical condition oppose an examination with both modalities (ULDCT of the chest, chest X-ray)\n-  assigned to chest X-ray as follow-up\n-  women with positive ß-HCG-test\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- the emergency departments assessment of a critical clinical condition oppose an examination with both modalities (ULDCT of the chest, chest X-ray)",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "ULDCT",\n                "chest X-ray",\n                "examination"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "ULDCT",\n                "chest X-ray",\n                "examination"\n              ],\n              "Condition": [\n                "clinical condition"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "clinical condition"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "chest"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "both"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "both"\n              ],\n              "Location": [\n                "emergency departments"\n              ],\n              "Severity": [\n                "critical"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- assigned to chest X-ray as follow-up",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "chest X-ray"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "chest X-ray"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "chest"\n              ],\n              "Encounter": [\n                "follow-up"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- women with positive ß-HCG-test",\n          "Observation": [\n            "ß-HCG-test"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "ß-HCG-test"\n          ],\n          "Polarity": [\n            "positive"\n          ],\n          "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n            "women"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": ""\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
