ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Effort oxygen therapy\n-  Cardiovascular, neuromuscular or musculoskeletal disorders that can provide significant dyspnea or limit exercise\n-  Legal incapacity\n-  Low or no cooperation anticipated\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Effort oxygen therapy",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "oxygen therapy"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "oxygen therapy"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "Effort"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Cardiovascular,",\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "Cardiovascular"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "neuromuscular",\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "neuromuscular"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "or musculoskeletal disorders that can provide significant dyspnea",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "disorders"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "disorders"\n                          ],\n                          "Modifier": [\n                            "musculoskeletal"\n                          ],\n                          "Observation": [\n                            "dyspnea"\n                          ],\n                          "Observation-Name": [\n                            "dyspnea"\n                          ],\n                          "Severity": [\n                            "significant"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "or limit exercise",\n                              "Observation": [\n                                "exercise"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation-Name": [\n                                "exercise"\n                              ],\n                              "Stability": [\n                                "limit"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "or other physical activity",\n                              "Observation": [\n                                "physical activity"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation-Name": [\n                                "physical activity"\n                              ],\n                              "Other": [\n                                "other"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Legal incapacity",\n          "Condition": [\n            "Legal incapacity"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n       