ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Pregnant woman;\n-  Patient present clinical signes of stroke and without CO detection.\nIn case of unusable data, patient will be excluded from study.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Pregnant woman;",\n          "Condition": [\n            "Pregnant"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "Pregnant"\n          ],\n          "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n            "woman"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Patient present clinical signes of stroke",\n              "Condition": [\n                "stroke"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "stroke"\n              ],\n              "Assertion": [\n                "signes"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "NOT": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "and without CO detection.",\n                  "Negation": [\n                    "without"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "CO detection"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "CO detection"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "In case of unusable data, patient will be excluded from study.",\n      "Study": [\n        "study"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
