ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Prisoners or any other high-risk population group.\n-  experiencing active psychosis\n-  experiencing active substance abuse disorder\n-  experiencing active suicidality\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Prisoners",\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "Prisoners"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "Prisoners"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or any other high-risk population group.",\n                  "Risk": [\n                    "risk"\n                  ],\n                  "Other": [\n                    "other"\n                  ],\n                  "Polarity": [\n                    "high"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- experiencing active psychosis",\n              "Condition": [\n                "psychosis"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "psychosis"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "active"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "active"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- experiencing active substance abuse disorder",\n          "Condition": [\n            "substance abuse disorder"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "substance abuse disorder"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "active"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "active"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- experiencing active suicidality",\n      "Condition": [\n        "suicidality"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "suicidality"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "active"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n        "active"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
