ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  BMI : 18-30 kg/m2 (Body Mass Index [BMI] [kg/m2] = Body weight [kg] Height2 [m2])\n-  Ability and willingness to abstain from alcohol, methylxanthine-containing beverages or food (coffee, tea, cola, chocolate, "powerdrinks"), grapefruit (juice) from 48 h prior to entry in the clinical research center until discharge\n-  Medical history without major pathology\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- BMI : 18-30 kg/m2 (Body Mass Index [BMI] [kg/m2] = Body weight [kg] Height2 [m2])",\n          "Observation": [\n            "Body Mass Index",\n            "BMI",\n            "Body weight",\n            "Height"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "Body Mass Index",\n            "BMI",\n            "Body weight",\n            "Height"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "18-30 kg/m2"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "18",\n            "30"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Unit": [\n            "kg",\n            "m2"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "-"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Ability and willingness to abstain from alcohol,",\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "-"\n              ],\n              "Drug": [\n                "alcohol"\n              ],\n              "Drug-Name": [\n                "alcohol"\n              ],\n              "Assertion": [\n                "Ability and w