ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Surgery, or pain relieving procedures within 2 weeks of entry into the study or during the study period\n-  Patients with history of substance abuse (Cut down, Annoyed, Guilty, Eye opener [CAGE] >= 2+), cognitively impaired (MD Anderson Symptom [MDAS] > 7)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Surgery,",\n          "Procedure": [\n            "Surgery"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "Surgery"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "or pain relieving procedures within 2 weeks of entry into the study",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "pain relieving procedures"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "pain relieving procedures"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "within 2 weeks"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "within"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "2"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "weeks"\n              ],\n              "Study": [\n                "study"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or during the study period",\n              "Study": [\n                "study"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patients with history of substance abuse (Cut down, Annoyed, Guilty, Eye opener [CAGE] >= 2+),",\n          "Condition": [\n            "substance abuse"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "substance abuse"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "history",\n            ">= 2+"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "history"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "Cut down, Annoyed, Guilty, Eye opener",\n            "CAGE"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "Cut down, Annoyed, Guilty, Eye opener",\n            "CAGE"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            ">=",\n            ">",\n            "to"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "2"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Unit": [\n            "+"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "cognitively impaired (MD Anderson Symptom [MDAS] > 7)",\n          "Condition": [\n            "cognitively impaired"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "cognitively impaired"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "MD Anderson Symptom",\n            "MDAS"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "MD Anderson Symptom",\n            "MDAS"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "> 7"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            ">"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "7"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
