ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Diagnosis of other musculoskeletal or developmental illness that might be responsible for the spinal curvature.\n-  Patients with symptom of a neurological disorder.\n-  Patients with any other disorder of the musculoskeletal system affecting the lower limbs,\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Diagnosis of other musculoskeletal",\n              "Other": [\n                "other"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "musculoskeletal"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or developmental illness that might be responsible for the spinal curvature.",\n              "Condition": [\n                "spinal curvature",\n                "illness"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "spinal curvature",\n                "illness"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "developmental"\n              ],\n              "Assertion": [\n                "might be"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patients with symptom of a neurological disorder.",\n          "Condition": [\n            "neurological disorder"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "neurological disorder"\n          ],\n          "Assertion": [\n            "symptom"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Patients with any other disorder of the musculoskeletal system affecting the lower limbs,",\n      "Condition": [\n        "disorder"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "disorder"\n      ],\n      "Other": [\n        "other"\n      ],\n      "Modifier": [\n        "musculoskeletal system",\n        "lower limbs"\n      ],\n      "Stability": [\n        "affecting"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
