ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  AIS.\n-  10-16 years old, with brace treatment.\n-  Ability to read and understand English or French.\n-  Physical and mental ability to adhere to bracing protocol.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- AIS.",\n              "Condition": [\n                "AIS"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "AIS"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- 10-16 years old, with brace treatment.",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "brace treatment"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "brace treatment"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "10-16 years"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "10",\n                "16"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "-"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "years"\n              ],\n              "Age": [\n                "old"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Ability to read and understand English",\n              "Language": [\n                "English"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "-"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or French.",\n              "L