ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Autosomal dominant polycystic kidney disease\n-  Unable or unwilling to give consent\n-  Previously received chronic dialysis\n-  Previous any organ transplant\n-  Patients who diagnosed heart failure with NYHA class 3 or 4\n-  Known liver cirrhosis (Child-pugh class 2 or 3)\n-  Pregnant women\n-  Single kidney due to trauma or donation\n-  Patients who received immunosuppressive agent within the past 1 year\n-  Patients who diagnosed with glomerulonephritis through kidney biopsy\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "AND": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "AND": {\n                                        "left": {\n                                          "AND": {\n                                            "left": {\n                                              "raw_text": "- Autosomal dominant polycystic kidney disease",\n                                              "Condition": [\n                                                "polycystic kidney disease"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                                "polycystic kidney disease"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Modifier": [\n                                                "Autosomal dominant"\n                                              ]\n                                            },\n                                            "right": {\n                                              "raw_text": "- Unable or unwilling to give consent"\n                                            }\n                                          }\n                                        },\n                                        "right": {\n                                          "raw_text": "- Previously received chronic dialysis",\n                                          "Procedure": [\n                                            "dialysis"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                                            "dialysis"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                            "Previously received"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                            "Previously received"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Acuteness": [\n                                            "chronic"\n                                          ]\n                                        }\n                                      }\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "raw_text": "- Previous any organ transplant",\n                                      "Procedure": [\n       